{#
  One list of the formation-mapping block: for each raw Desk value, what
  the site currently knows about it, and the form that decides (or
  re-decides) which step it means.

  Written once because the two lists it serves — « Valeurs non reconnues »
  and « Rattachements déjà enregistrés » — are the same row with a
  different verb. They had drifted already: only one of them offered a
  placeholder option, and only one had a remove button, which is correct;
  but the select's width, its visually-hidden label and its size were
  three chances for them to stop matching for no reason.

  This partial owns the surrounding list as well as each item, rather than
  taking one row and letting the caller supply the list around it. Both
  are needed for the markup to be checkable: a partial holding a bare item
  has no way to show a static HTML checker that it is only ever rendered
  inside a list, and the checker reads each template file on its own.

  A list, not a table, deliberately (see training.html.twig): four columns
  of a select, a button and a variable-length Desk string do not fit a
  375px screen, and a control a chief has to scroll sideways to reach is
  not "lisible sur téléphone".

  Parameters:
    rows             -- [{ raw_value, detail, field_id, selected }, …]
                        raw_value  the Desk string itself
                        detail     the French sentence under it (how many
                                   people, or which step it is attached to)
                        field_id   unique id for that row's select
                        selected   the step value currently chosen, or null
                                   for a value nobody has decided yet
    steps            -- assignable_steps: [{ value, label }, …]
    submit_label     -- « Rattacher » or « Modifier »
    removable        -- whether to offer the trash button (only a decision
                        can be undone; there is nothing to remove from a
                        value nobody decided)
#}
<ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
    {% for row in rows %}
        {% set _selected = row.selected|default(null) %}
        {% set _options = steps|default([])|map(step => {
            value: step.value,
            label: step.label,
            selected: _selected is not null and step.value == _selected,
        }) %}
        {% if _selected is null %}
            {% set _options = [{ value: '', label: 'Choisir une étape…' }]|merge(_options) %}
        {% endif %}

        <li class="list-group-item px-0 py-3">
            <div class="fw-semibold text-break"><code>{{ row.raw_value }}</code></div>
            <div class="small text-body-secondary mb-2">{{ row.detail }}</div>
            <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 align-items-center">
                <form method="post" action="/admin/leadership/training/mapping"
                      class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 align-items-center">
                    {{ csrf_field()|raw }}
                    <input type="hidden" name="raw_value" value="{{ row.raw_value }}">
                    {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                        field_id: row.field_id,
                        field_name: 'step',
                        label: 'Étape pour « ' ~ row.raw_value ~ ' »',
                        label_visually_hidden: true,
                        type: 'select',
                        size: 'sm',
                        control_class_extra: 'w-auto',
                        wrapper_class: 'mb-0',
                        options: _options,
                    } only %}
                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary">{{ submit_label }}</button>
                </form>
                {% if removable|default(false) %}
                    <form method="post" action="/admin/leadership/training/mapping"
                          data-confirm="Supprimer le rattachement de « {{ row.raw_value }} » ? Cette valeur redeviendra non reconnue tant qu'elle ne sera pas rattachée à nouveau.">
                        {{ csrf_field()|raw }}
                        <input type="hidden" name="raw_value" value="{{ row.raw_value }}">
                        <input type="hidden" name="step" value="">
                        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-danger"
                                aria-label="Supprimer le rattachement de {{ row.raw_value }}">
                            <i class="bi bi-trash" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                        </button>
                    </form>
                {% endif %}
            </div>
        </li>
    {% endfor %}
</ul>
